s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115160.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115160.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"**AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist** was ignoring the pitch_scale passed to mix(), always mixing child streams at **1.0** and advancing time at a **fixed rate**.\r\n\r\nThis caused **incorrect timing** and gaps when pitch_scale different from 1.0.\r\n\r\nThis change makes playback time and mixing respect p_rate_scale.\r\n\r\nWatch the video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcWprMLs7Kk\r\n\r\n- Bugsquad edit: closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104527","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115160/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}